{% extends 'layout/layout.twig' %}

{%- set overridePageTitle = 'Shared space' -%}

{% block content %}

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
      <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">{{ overridePageTitle }}</h1>

      <p class="govuk-body">A shared space means that you and other authorised users have access  to view and edit all the LPAs you’ve each made, both before and after joining it.</p>
      <p class="govuk-body">This is particularly useful for organisations, such as charities or legal professionals, that make lots of LPAs on behalf of the people they help.</p>
      <p class="govuk-body">You can become a member of a shared space by either creating or joining one.</p>

      <div class="govuk-inset-text">
        <p class="govuk-body">Before creating or joining a shared space, be aware that</p>
        <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
          <li>any LPAs you’ve already made, and any you make in future, will belong to the shared space</li>
          <li>your account will only let you be a member of one shared space at a time</li>
          <li>if you choose to leave a shared space you’d need to delete your account. The LPAs you created or worked on will remain available to the users who still have access to the shared space</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Creating a shared space</h2>

      <p class="govuk-body">You can create and name a shared space.</p>
      <p class="govuk-body">As the person creating the shared space, you'd be an administrator, or 'admin'. Admins manage who is a member of the shared space and can choose which other members can be admins.</p>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Joining a shared space</h2>

      <p class="govuk-body">You can join a shared space if you’ve received an email inviting you to do so. You’ll need to enter the name of the shared space and the 8-digit code that are included in the email.</p>

      <div class="govuk-button-group">
        <a class="govuk-button app-use-standard" href="{{ url('shared-space/make') }}">Create a shared space</a>
        <a class="govuk-button govuk-button--secondary app-use-standard" href="{{ url('shared-space/join') }}">Join a shared space using a code</a>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>

{% endblock content %}
